hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1455","Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdul-Hakam told us, my father and Shuaib told us, saying: Al-Layth told us, and Khalid, who is Yazid, told us, on the authority of Ibn Abi Hilal, who is Saeed, on the authority of Iyad bin Abdullah bin Saad, on the authority of Abi Saeed Al-Khudri, that he said: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, addressed us One day, may God bless him and grant him peace, he recited the Prophet, and when he passed the prostration, he descended and prostrated, and we prostrated with him, and he recited it another time, so when he reached the prostration, we were pleased. To prostrate. When he saw us, he said: “It is only the repentance of a prophet, but I see that you have prepared for prostration.” So he came down and prostrated, and we prostrated."
